[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Subsystem: Environment Perception
VERSION: @GIT_BRANCH

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
**Scope**: The Environment perception subsystem includes the IMU and the barometer.

IMU: The IMU's main purpose is to detect when the user has taken a step, and the provide acceleration data to the MCU to improve the PPG readings.

Barometer: The barometer's purpose is to indicate what altitude the user is at during a recorded activity.
<<<

